{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f A horror game / walking simulator set across seven distinct maps, each with small puzzles and challenges. The maps can be accessed in any order chosen by the player, with the final goal of opening a mysterious door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.poster.avif?t=1772035271\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.webm?t=1772035271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/6975bc6bb2b88275285af31ac114404e.mp4?t=1772035271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of the character Yindy, not knowing much about her \u2014 other than the certainty that she\u2019s just as confused as you are. Some intriguing characters may offer answers\u2026 but what can really be trusted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.poster.avif?t=1772035271\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.webm?t=1772035271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/1e6e7853ee5b1e6ef62c2ed7e7f73c96.mp4?t=1772035271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Yindy, every decision changes the island in some way, making each playthrough unique depending on your choices. Different events are unlocked, new structures appear, new paths emerge, and many other mysteries can be discovered... or not...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.poster.avif?t=1772035271\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.webm?t=1772035271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892470/extras/5f5576d8426fb128e3b01d834e96dc3a.mp4?t=1772035271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"HOW CUTE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892470/ede2f4fcfa01836a3f7e5ff46f70400e7e55e2c0.jpg"},{"name":"THE TREE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892470/ede2f4fcfa01836a3f7e5ff46f70400e7e55e2c0.jpg"},{"name":"THE CHURCH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892470/ede2f4fcfa01836a3f7e5ff46f70400e7e55e2c0.jpg"},{"name":"THE WELL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892470/ede2f4fcfa01836a3f7e5ff46f70400e7e55e2c0.jpg"},{"name":"THE PINCH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892470/ede2f4fcfa01836a3f7e5ff46f70400e7e55e2c0.jpg"},{"name":"THE CAVE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892470/ede2f4fcfa01836a3f7e5ff46f70400e7e55e2c0.jpg"},{"name":"THE TOMB","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3892470/ede2f4fcfa01836a3f7e5ff46f70400e7e55e2c0.jpg"},{"name":"THE COLD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a